.th CV I 8/12/77
.sh NAME
cv - number base conversion
.sh SYNOPSIS
cv -XY value ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
Arguments are one or more numbers in base X,
to be printed in base Y.
Each value must fit in a 32-bit word.

Possible bases are:
'in +10

.lp +4 4
b	Binary

.lp +4 4
c	Ascii characters

.lp +4 4
o	Octal

.lp +4 4
l	Unsigned decimal integer

.lp +4 4
d	Signed decimal integer

.lp +4 4
h	Hexadecimal
.i0
.in -10
.sh AUTHOR
R Miller
